# uwhichcard-catalog approval required

The catalog repo (`davyuonggd/uwhichcard-catalog`) holds production card-rewards data fetched by the app at runtime.

Before any git write to that repo (commit, push, merge, or `gh pr create`):
1. Show the full diff and summarize what changed.
2. Wait for explicit user approval (e.g. "approved", "commit it", "push it").
3. Never push directly to `main` or `develop` unless the user explicitly requests a direct push.

Default workflow: edit locally → present diff → user approves → push to a feature branch and open a PR (or direct push only if user asks).
